<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your friend!</font>

53
00:02:12,610 --> 00:02:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I'm telling you</font>

54
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:17,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna let the likes
of Orochimaru get you!</font>

55
00:02:17,150 --> 00:02:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you that I'll stop you...</font>

56
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if it means breaking
every bone in your arms and legs!</font>

57
00:03:09,710 --> 00:03:12,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style:
Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

58
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:59,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on! Wake up already!</font>

59
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:04,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't come to your senses
