<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who has neither parents nor brothers,
think you understand?</font>

64
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:30,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What makes you think that you
who's been all alone from the start</font>

65
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can understand anything about me?!</font>

66
00:04:36,630 --> 00:04:39,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because I have the ties
that I feel this agony.</font>

67
00:04:39,590 --> 00:04:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could you possibly understand...</font>

68
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:44,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what it feels like to lose all that!</font>

69
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true that I can't understand...</font>

70
00:05:15,290 --> 00:05:17,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how it feels to really
have parents or brothers...</font>

71
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:20,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

72
00:05:20,250 --> 00:05:22,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my treat today...
Eat your fill!</font>

73
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yippee!</font>

74
00:05:25,090 --> 00:05:29,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I'm with Iruka-sensei
I imagine...</font>

75
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:31,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Dig in!
— Dig in!</font>

76
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi, first of all need, to
warm their inner man.</font>

77
00:05:37,850 --> 00:05:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey! Don't get too carried away
and overeat!</font>

78
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this is...
what it feels like to have a dad.</font>

79
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:51,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I'm with you...</font>

80
00:05:52,030 --> 00:05:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot, idiot, idiot...</font>

81
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that, useless?!</font>

82
00:05:57,870 --> 00:06:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna lose to you
no matter what!</font>

83
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go ahead and say
whatever you want.</font>

84
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about this?</font>

85
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Better not start feeling
too comfortable.</font>

86
00:06:09,090 --> 00:06:12,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder... if having a brother
feels something like that.</font>

87
00:06:14,890 --> 00:06:16,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it Naruto...?</font>

88
00:06:17,850 --> 00:06:20,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it that you go to
this extent for me...?</font>

89
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:24,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For me it's a tie that
I've finally been able to have!</font>

90
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:49,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I'm gonna stop you.</font>

91
00:06:57,270 --> 00:07:03,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late, Naruto...
It's already too late.</font>

92
00:07:05,820 --> 00:07:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't go back anymore.</font>

93
00:07:22,670 --> 00:07:24,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come Naruto!</font>

94
00:07:25,090 --> 00:07:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case,
I just have to cut that tie.</font>

95
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:36,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cut, huh?</font>

96
00:07:39,770 --> 00:07:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why wear that headband now?</font>

97
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:47,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll acknowledge you...
You're strong.</font>

98
00:07:48,690 --> 00:07:50,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the reason for that is</font>

99
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:53,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're someone who knows
the pain of solitude as I do.</font>

100
00:07:54,070 --> 00:07:57,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that pain makes people stronger.</font>

101
00:07:58,200 --> 00:08:01,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And for that very reason
by cutting that tie</font>

102
00:08:01,330 --> 00:08:04,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will be able to obtain
even greater strength.</font>

103
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will fight you now on equal terms.
However...</font>

104
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:14,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't even be able to
inflict a scratch on my forehead.</font>

105
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's something that
won't change in the least.</font>

106
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:24,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that whatever I say
won't have any effect anymore, huh?</font>

107
00:08:26,190 --> 00:08:27,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

108
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm done with talking...</font>

109
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on it's only fighting.</font>

110
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come!</font>

111
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm able to see...</font>

112
00:09:08,230 --> 00:09:10,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm now able to see
this guy's movements...</font>

113
00:09:10,230 --> 00:09:12,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which I wasn't able to see before.</font>

114
00:09:14,990 --> 00:09:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm able to see them!</font>

115
00:09:26,290 --> 00:09:29,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke's moving completely
different from a few moments ago.</font>

116
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I couldn't care less!</font>

117
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case, I can't afford to lose!</font>

118
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

119
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:47,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It must be the influence of my body
getting used to the state of Curse Mark.</font>

120
00:09:49,730 --> 00:09:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When he moves...</font>

121
00:09:51,270 --> 00:09:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by the subtle movements in
the way he exerts his strength...</font>

122
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can vividly see
an image of his next move.</font>

123
00:10:07,830 --> 00:10:09,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With my level of "eyes",</font>

124
00:10:09,630 --> 00:10:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need to use unnecessary Chakra
and can instead preserve it.</font>

125
00:10:13,710 --> 00:10:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark takes
too much Chakra.</font>

126
00:10:18,470 --> 00:10:20,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can see this much...</font>

127
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:26,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can time my attacks to the images of
Naruto's movements as I foresee them.</font>

128
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:45,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no good...</font>

129
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:49,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's totally reading my movements.</font>

130
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:53,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

131
00:11:06,930 --> 00:11:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, there you are.</font>

132
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake it's this way, right?</font>

133
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

134
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:18,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We better hurry.
I have a bad premonition.</font>

135
00:12:13,580 --> 00:12:15,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

136
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style:
Dragon Flame Jutsu!</font>

137
00:13:16,980 --> 00:13:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sa-su-ke...</font>

138
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late, Naruto.</font>

139
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late now! Naruto!</font>

140
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're weak aren't you, kid?</font>

141
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You better be grateful to me...</font>

142
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:57,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and to the Fourth Hokage</font>

143
00:14:58,040 --> 00:15:02,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who contained me within
the likes of you!</font>

144
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

145
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that just now?</font>

146
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I'm able to read
Naruto's movements completely...</font>

147
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:57,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his Chakra makes
a separate move of its own.</font>

148
00:16:58,780 --> 00:17:02,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like the Chakra itself is moving
in accordance with its own will...</font>

149
00:17:04,500 --> 00:17:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even with my "eyes"
I'm unable to read it completely.</font>

150
00:17:08,250 --> 00:17:11,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That red Chakra...
that's not an ordinary Chakra!</font>

151
00:17:14,420 --> 00:17:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your target is Naruto after all.</font>

152
00:17:17,050 --> 00:17:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To abduct Naruto-kun
is the No.1 priority</font>

153
00:17:20,470 --> 00:17:24,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">placed by our organization, Akatsuki!</font>

154
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:26,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

155
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears that you have
some kind of special power.</font>

156
00:17:31,530 --> 00:17:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I understand!</font>

157
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style:
Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

158
00:18:05,730 --> 00:18:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Chakra is protecting him?!</font>

159
00:18:11,730 --> 00:18:12,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down.</font>

160
00:18:13,690 --> 00:18:17,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be caught as long as
I fight from a distance.</font>

161
00:19:13,630 --> 00:19:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... This is incredible!</font>

162
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I can do is dodge...</font>

163
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please let me get there in time.</font>

164
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:09,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it, gimme a break...</font>

165
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I get tainted by this power...</font>

166
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't even know what
will happen to me in the end...</font>

167
00:20:20,320 --> 00:20:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it can't be helped
can it, Naruto?</font>

168
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is certainly true
that you were special...</font>

169
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

170
00:20:44,840 --> 00:20:47,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am even more special than you.</font>

171
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

172
00:21:11,990 --> 00:21:16,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

173
00:21:11,990 --> 00:21:16,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

174
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

175
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

176
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:27,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

177
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:27,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

178
00:21:27,570 --> 00:21:33,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

179
00:21:27,570 --> 00:21:33,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

180
00:21:33,940 --> 00:21:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

181
00:21:33,940 --> 00:21:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

182
00:21:39,520 --> 00:21:43,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a hint of warmth,</font></font></font></font>

183
00:21:39,560 --> 00:21:43,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitokira no nukumori to</font></font></font></font>

184
00:21:45,270 --> 00:21:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">and this distant yearning for you</font></font></font></font>

185
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">haruka kanata no akogare to</font></font></font></font>

186
00:21:50,740 --> 00:21:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I live,</font></font></font></font>

187
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:53,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">tada sore dake wo</font></font></font></font>

188
00:21:53,570 --> 00:21:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">simply repeating this cycle</font></font></font></font>

189
00:21:53,620 --> 00:21:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kurikaeshi boku wa ikite iru</font></font></font></font>

190
00:22:01,710 --> 00:22:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">held in my two hands</font></font></font></font>

191
00:22:01,750 --> 00:22:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono ryoute ni kakaete iru mono</font></font></font></font>

192
00:22:08,590 --> 00:22:11,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a droplet of time</font></font></font></font>

193
00:22:08,630 --> 00:22:11,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">toki no shizuku</font></font></font></font>

194
00:22:12,630 --> 00:22:18,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">softly clutching forgotten memories</font></font></font></font>

195
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:18,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">sotto nigirishimete wasureta kioku</font></font></font></font>

196
00:22:18,970 --> 00:22:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">lost words</font></font></font></font>

197
00:22:19,020 --> 00:22:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">nakushita kotoba</font></font></font></font>

198
00:22:30,740 --> 00:22:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I'll keep these thoughts...</font></font></font></font>

199
00:22:30,780 --> 00:22:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono omoi wa</font></font></font></font>

200
00:22:37,410 --> 00:22:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn! My body hurts!</font>

201
00:22:41,130 --> 00:22:42,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">And to make it worse</font>

202
00:22:42,750 --> 00:22:45,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I've completely lost feeling
in my left arm!</font>

203
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Apparently this power
isn't something that</font>

204
00:22:49,130 --> 00:22:52,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I can just keep on using continuously!</font>

205
00:22:53,560 --> 00:22:57,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But... I can't give up!</font>

206
00:22:58,350 --> 00:23:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">My next blow is
going to be the end!</font>

207
00:23:02,150 --> 00:23:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Concluded in a Rain of Tears."</font>

